          "content": "kit-version-source: 0.3.0 · brief-schema: 1 · updated: 2026-09-27\nSame flow, rules and copy as the mobile band.\n3. SCREENS (columns are the steps; step 4 has no desktop screen: the mobile states apply)\n- Home\n- One screen, no expert connected: the banner above the two columns (at most 760 wide, so it reads); kind, measures and description on the left, photos on the right\n- One screen, empty: the same without the banner\n- One screen, filled: fits in 900 px without scrolling\n- Analyzing\n6. STATES NOT DRAWN\nThe mobile states band applies as is: errors and the missing key sit above the actions, in the left column's width.",
